{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beautiful, haunting soundtrack to the game Everdeep Aurora, composed by Viktor Kraus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Everdeep Aurora</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ongoing apocalyptic meteor shower has forced the world\u2019s population to settle underground. As Shell, a feline child who awakens to find her mother missing, you will drill downward into the depths to discover a hidden subterranean world and its inhabitants: tormented creatures with an uncertain past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This narrative exploration and platform game inspired by 16-bit aesthetics will take you back to the simplicity and excitement of the classics of that era. There\u2019s a vibrant and dynamic world to explore, and lots of peculiar characters to meet and varied puzzles to solve. Will you discover the secrets hidden in the Everdeep?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883130?t=1759173080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883130?t=1759173080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883130/6018fb4d2aa80ef979f65d9055e6ce44b4f88ae4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759173080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883130/6018fb4d2aa80ef979f65d9055e6ce44b4f88ae4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759173080","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beautiful, haunting soundtrack to the game Everdeep Aurora, composed by Viktor Kraus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Everdeep Aurora</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ongoing apocalyptic meteor shower has forced the world\u2019s population to settle underground. As Shell, a feline child who awakens to find her mother missing, you will drill downward into the depths to discover a hidden subterranean world and its inhabitants: tormented creatures with an uncertain past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This narrative exploration and platform game inspired by 16-bit aesthetics will take you back to the simplicity and excitement of the classics of that era. There\u2019s a vibrant and dynamic world to explore, and lots of peculiar characters to meet and varied puzzles to solve. Will you discover the secrets hidden in the Everdeep?</p>","developers":["Nautilus Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2251400","name":"Everdeep Aurora"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883130/b078e11d4ed2f7568cbadd3f4d783e84b2a7f776/header.jpg?t=1759173080","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Nautilus Games. All rights reserved. Published by Ysbryd Games Worldwide Limited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883130/938071671/9bf960e70e96593733415c8956debc74d584c87a/1759171892/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759173074","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883130/938071671/9bf960e70e96593733415c8956debc74d584c87a/1759171892/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759173074","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883130/938071671/9bf960e70e96593733415c8956debc74d584c87a/1759171892/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759173074","id":257208797,"name":"The Moon- Teaser song","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208797/069b9d17d144e927f9d7000198b80d6084ee8270/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759173074"}],"name":"Everdeep Aurora Soundtrack","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Everdeep Aurora Sound